                                                "sense_id": "6aaedff2-bf80-36f4-8aa6-a800c52c8759",
                                                "text": "Many bills, both domestic and foreign, are at last presented for payment quite covered with indorsements, each of which represents either a fresh discounting, or a pecuniary transaction in which the bill has performed the functions of money."
